<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16411" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπονδ-εί</span></b>  (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπονδ-ί</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			<u>SIG</u>
			110
		</span></i> (Rhodes, <span class="entity">v B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
			187
		</span></i> (Cnidus, <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>), Adv. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσπονδος</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without truce, implacably,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολεμεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.195
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φονᾶν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				423
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of peace,
				<i>without formal treaty,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσυλεὶ καὶ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					168.9
				</span></i>
			 (Erythrae, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IPE</u>
				2.1
			</span></i> (Panticapaeum, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>), etc.</div>
